// Folio file icons.
//
// Each entry describes one icon:
//   id      unique key (becomes the SVG file name)
//   glyph   name from glyphs.js   — or —   mono: a 1–4 character monogram
//   hue     OKLCH hue (0–360); hue2 optional gradient end; chroma 0..1+ factor
//   badge   optional glyph drawn as a small corner badge (config, lock, …)
//   ext     file extensions, without the leading dot (multi-part allowed)
//   names   exact file names (matched case-insensitively)
//   langs   VS Code language ids
// Matching priority: names → longest extension → language → default.

